+ * index can move before the item's data is in host memory. Each item then
+ * carries a sequence number in its epoch byte (from 254, mod 253, as for H2D)
+ * and makes the XOR of its 32-bit words zero. bcmdhd polls for both, up to
+ * 512 tries at each of five delay steps (100 us per step), then skips the
+ * item.
